  "implementation": "Store a few fixed numeric primitives. Use one enclosing broadphase, then these primitives only for nearby contacts; no GLB decode or mesh scan in per-frame collision code. Carry contact role body/wheel/mirror so mirror-only overlap can be treated independently instead of making every outlier a terminal strike. Keep geometric detection separate from response/severity rules.",
